Subject: [PATCH] Save Account is on by default

The login screen remembers the account unless the player says otherwise.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LFcBNQtF3Z7vfzi99BXwUe
